{"3847450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Project S.U.N.D.I.A.L", "steam_appid": 3847450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/extras/2bd261c96400730784702116fce2d1b6.avif?t=1784062661\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/extras_big/2bd261c96400730784702116fce2d1b6.avif?t=1784062661 width=1560 height=454 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Project S.U.N.D.I.A.L.</strong> is a PvPvE extraction shooter playable in single-player or online. You are a Contractor, a Hollow Hunter of Unit 13. The Hollows are as deadly as they are mysterious, hiding secrets that many seek to uncover for their own gain. Will you remain loyal, work for the highest bidder, or pursue your own agenda?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter dangerous regions, gather valuable loot, complete contracts, recruit survivors, expand your hideout, and battle players, raiders, and terrifying Hollows. Reach the extraction zone before you lose everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Stakes Hardcore PvPvE Combat</strong>                                                                                  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outsmart enemies both human and non-human as you sneak or shoot your way through roaming mutated wildlife, ruthless raider or the hollows. Encounter other players in the lawless wastes. Are you going to cooperate with other players for mutual survival or betray them for a chance at priceless loot? Every expedition is high tension, where betrayal can strike at any moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/extras/5e23682d8262d509ce31f14fca43bd92.poster.avif?t=1784062661\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/extras/5e23682d8262d509ce31f14fca43bd92.webm?t=1784062661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/extras/5e23682d8262d509ce31f14fca43bd92.mp4?t=1784062661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extraction Tension</strong>                                                                                                                     </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get in, grab what you can, and extract before it’s too late. But nothing is easy in this postapocalyptic world. Die, and you lose everything you’re carrying. Survive, and you keep your hard-won loot to fight another day. Each run is a high-risk gambling. How much will you wager on your life?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/extras/aa1ace063bcc397ee47938313944edd4.poster.avif?t=1784062661\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/extras/aa1ace063bcc397ee47938313944edd4.webm?t=1784062661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/extras/aa1ace063bcc397ee47938313944edd4.mp4?t=1784062661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hardcore Survival Mechanics</strong>                                                                                           </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endure a true survival challenge with realistic body part damage simulation. Get shot in the leg and you’ll struggle to move or bleed out if you forgot your bandages. Head wounds blur vision, cause confusion, or most likely ends you on the spot. Handle radiation exposure, toxins, hunger, thirst, heat, cold and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/extras/14d19e2c038f52a7d48f94d380c63f05.poster.avif?t=1784062661\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/extras/14d19e2c038f52a7d48f94d380c63f05.webm?t=1784062661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/extras/14d19e2c038f52a7d48f94d380c63f05.mp4?t=1784062661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Regions, Endless Adventures</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore handcrafted regions enhanced by semi-procedural layouts, dynamic events, and fully procedural NPCs. From ruined cities and toxic wastelands to dense forests, underground bunkers, hidden caves, and remote fjords, every raid unfolds differently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/extras/85b840b0d674d3f8aa313395e4e3361d.poster.avif?t=1784062661\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/extras/85b840b0d674d3f8aa313395e4e3361d.webm?t=1784062661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/extras/85b840b0d674d3f8aa313395e4e3361d.mp4?t=1784062661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gun Customization:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm yourself with an unparalleled weapon customization system. Every firearm is a canvas for modification, featuring up to 15 interchangeable parts. Swap barrels, stocks, scopes, triggers, and more to forge a weapon that suits your playstyle. Craft the best weapons of which you can think of!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/extras/dfa24da1d9063558cfc793c94a943d09.poster.avif?t=1784062661\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/extras/dfa24da1d9063558cfc793c94a943d09.webm?t=1784062661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/extras/dfa24da1d9063558cfc793c94a943d09.mp4?t=1784062661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anomalies</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unstable rifts that tear open without warning, twisting the laws of nature. Some burn your skin just by being near, others warp gravity or corrode machines where they stand. Anomalies are unpredictable: they might kill you, disorient you, or reveal things no one was meant to see. Yet for those who take the risk, they can hide powerful items, rare resources, and secrets worth dying for. Every encounter is a gamble - step away, or step in and discover what lies beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/extras/a7efebf4ab4b9ca9db34d89e3ae832c5.poster.avif?t=1784062661\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/extras/a7efebf4ab4b9ca9db34d89e3ae832c5.webm?t=1784062661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/extras/a7efebf4ab4b9ca9db34d89e3ae832c5.mp4?t=1784062661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are what your wear</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your appearance changes with the armor you equip. Judge an NPC or player’s strength by their gear, and guess what loot they might drop if you win. Is the risk worth the reward?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/extras/4e7429b0fedb39293d00e03c8a280cc8.poster.avif?t=1784062661\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/extras/4e7429b0fedb39293d00e03c8a280cc8.webm?t=1784062661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/extras/4e7429b0fedb39293d00e03c8a280cc8.mp4?t=1784062661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quests, Bosses &amp; Events</strong><br>Each match is more than loot and extraction. While you scavenge, events unfold in real time: a distress signal, a fallen drone, or a raider ambush. Some lead to rare loot. Others to death. Powerful Bosses roam the map like mutants, cannibals, hollows and much more. What you going when you face them? Run for you life or try to get super rare gear? What’s more worth?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/extras/eeb81f110c6c4dbce4be4af4a454f87d.poster.avif?t=1784062661\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/extras/eeb81f110c6c4dbce4be4af4a454f87d.webm?t=1784062661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/extras/eeb81f110c6c4dbce4be4af4a454f87d.mp4?t=1784062661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Hideout &amp; Crafting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Project S.U.N.D.I.A.L, crafting is deep, flexible, and essential. You can ignore it… but how long will you last without bullets, armor, or meds? Smelt ores in the refinery. Craft armor in the workshop. Not satisfied? Recycle and recover materials to try again. Build a Gamer Room to help survivors reduce stress - or play a few games yourself. Hit the Gym to toughen up for the wasteland. Expand your hideout with farms, storage, lab and much more. Assign survivors to roles like mechanic, doctor, cook, or farmer - each offering unique skills and bonuses. They’ll work for you… if you keep them breathing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/extras/32d11e84caf03a8043a2440d08c71dbd.poster.avif?t=1784062661\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/extras/32d11e84caf03a8043a2440d08c71dbd.webm?t=1784062661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/extras/32d11e84caf03a8043a2440d08c71dbd.mp4?t=1784062661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Weather &amp; Seasons:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every map shifts with time - visit the same location in winter and you’ll find new paths, different enemies, unique quests, and NPCs who only appear under certain conditions. But the weather doesn’t just change the world - it changes how you survive. Don’t walk into a snowstorm in rags. Don’t wear a bomb suit in the desert sun.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/extras/9258525e07d3daafa5213f10b02740e2.avif?t=1784062661\" width=612 height=153 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/extras/2bd261c96400730784702116fce2d1b6.avif?t=1784062661\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/extras_big/2bd261c96400730784702116fce2d1b6.avif?t=1784062661 width=1560 height=454 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Project S.U.N.D.I.A.L.</strong> is a PvPvE extraction shooter playable in single-player or online. You are a Contractor, a Hollow Hunter of Unit 13. The Hollows are as deadly as they are mysterious, hiding secrets that many seek to uncover for their own gain. Will you remain loyal, work for the highest bidder, or pursue your own agenda?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter dangerous regions, gather valuable loot, complete contracts, recruit survivors, expand your hideout, and battle players, raiders, and terrifying Hollows. Reach the extraction zone before you lose everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Stakes Hardcore PvPvE Combat</strong>                                                                                  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outsmart enemies both human and non-human as you sneak or shoot your way through roaming mutated wildlife, ruthless raider or the hollows. Encount