7450/extras/85b840b0d674d3f8aa313395e4e3361d.webm?t=1784062661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/extras/85b840b0d674d3f8aa313395e4e3361d.mp4?t=1784062661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gun Customization:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm yourself with an unparalleled weapon customization system. Every firearm is a canvas for modification, featuring up to 15 interchangeable parts. Swap barrels, stocks, scopes, triggers, and more to forge a weapon that suits your playstyle. Craft the best weapons of which you can think of!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/extras/dfa24da1d9063558cfc793c94a943d09.poster.avif?t=1784062661\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/extras/dfa24da1d9063558cfc793c94a943d09.webm?t=1784062661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/extras/dfa24da1d9063558cfc793c94a943d09.mp4?t=1784062661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anomalies</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unstable rifts that tear open without warning, twisting the laws of nature. Some burn your skin just by being near, others warp gravity or corrode machines where they stand. Anomalies are unpredictable: they might kill you, disorient you, or reveal things no one was meant to see. Yet for those who take the risk, they can hide powerful items, rare resources, and secrets worth dying for. Every encounter is a gamble - step away, or step in and discover what lies beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/extras/a7efebf4ab4b9ca9db34d89e3ae832c5.poster.avif?t=1784062661\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/extras/a7efebf4ab4b9ca9db34d89e3ae832c5.webm?t=1784062661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/extras/a7efebf4ab4b9ca9db34d89e3ae832c5.mp4?t=1784062661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are what your wear</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your appearance changes with the armor you equip. Judge an NPC or player’s strength by their gear, and guess what loot they might drop if you win. Is the risk worth the reward?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/extras/4e7429b0fedb39293d00e03c8a280cc8.poster.avif?t=1784062661\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/extras/4e7429b0fedb39293d00e03c8a280cc8.webm?t=1784062661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/extras/4e7429b0fedb39293d00e03c8a280cc8.mp4?t=1784062661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quests, Bosses &amp; Events</strong><br>Each match is more than loot and extraction. While you scavenge, events unfold in real time: a distress signal, a fallen drone, or a raider ambush. Some lead to rare loot. Others to death. Powerful Bosses roam the map like mutants, cannibals, hollows and much more. What you going when you face them? Run for you life or try to get super rare gear? What’s more worth?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/extras/eeb81f110c6c4dbce4be4af4a454f87d.poster.avif?t=1784062661\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/extras/eeb81f110c6c4dbce4be4af4a454f87d.webm?t=1784062661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/extras/eeb81f110c6c4dbce4be4af4a454f87d.mp4?t=1784062661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Hideout &amp; Crafting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Project S.U.N.D.I.A.L, crafting is deep, flexible, and essential. You can ignore it… but how long will you last without bullets, armor, or meds? Smelt ores in the refinery. Craft armor in the workshop. Not satisfied? Recycle and recover materials to try again. Build a Gamer Room to help survivors reduce stress - or play a few games yourself. Hit the Gym to toughen up for the wasteland. Expand your hideout with farms, storage, lab and much more. Assign survivors to roles like mechanic, doctor, cook, or farmer - each offering unique skills and bonuses. They’ll work for you… if you keep them breathing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/extras/32d11e84caf03a8043a2440d08c71dbd.poster.avif?t=1784062661\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/extras/32d11e84caf03a8043a2440d08c71dbd.webm?t=1784062661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/extras/32d11e84caf03a8043a2440d08c71dbd.mp4?t=1784062661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Weather &amp; Seasons:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every map shifts with time - visit the same location in winter and you’ll find new paths, different enemies, unique quests, and NPCs who only appear under certain conditions. But the weather doesn’t just change the world - it changes how you survive. Don’t walk into a snowstorm in rags. Don’t wear a bomb suit in the desert sun.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/extras/9258525e07d3daafa5213f10b02740e2.avif?t=1784062661\" width=612 height=153 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Project S.U.N.D.I.A.L. is a PvPvE extraction shooter playable in single-player or online. Explore a shattered Europe, battle hostile players, ruthless raiders, and terrifying Hollows, then fight your way to extraction.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Ukrainian<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/ac9c0490a0a2773861fd26e9bb89d420b1ca761e/header.jpg?t=1784062661", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/00ca9c2c41df83077730d7795485dea22a69f7c4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784062661", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847450/00ca9c2c41df83077730d7795485dea22a69f7c4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784062661", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> OS: Windows 7 SP1 or ne